  "details": "Interaction with a spawned object (a stick from \"campfire\" item) caused disconnect with \"Unusual client behavior\" message.\n\n I grabbed a stick that was spawned by someone, I was pressing the trigger rapidly and poking other player with it.\n\n A week or so I heard that the very same thing happened to another player.  It was Murder4 lobby and the same asset (a stick with from campfire asset).\n\nAttaching a zipped log file fails with \"Invalid file (8 mb max)\" error message despite the archive is 1 mib and attaching a 2 mib text file fails with \"Failed to upload file\" error message.\n\nAny other options to  attach a log file?\n\nBuild: 2025.3.2p1-1696-55635ce2b2-Release",
